	ZH 1:
	'Go back. I don’t want you.'
	\L_012b2:
	\L_012a5:
	\L_011fd:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...? Um...'
	\L_012b2:
	\L_012a5:
	\L_0118d:
	ZH 1:
	'I said I don’t want you.'
	R
	'Go back to your room.'
	\L_012b2:
	\L_012a5:
	\L_011fd:
	ZH 1:
	'But you summoned me...'
	\L_012b2:
	\L_012a5:
	\L_0118d:
	ZH 1:
	'I made some sort of mistake.'
	R
	'Go back, that should be'
	R
	'preferable for you too.'
	\L_012b2:
	\L_012a5:
	\L_011fd:
	ZH 1:
	'Hah... Haah...'
	R
	'I’ll go back, then...'
	\L_012b2:
	\L_012a5:
	\L_0118d:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, sleep well.'
	\L_012b2:
	\L_012a5:
	\L_011c5:
	ZH 1:
	'Saitou the Spy trudged back to'
